## Lemma Target
Audited finite form:
  dead_components(row) > 0  =>  row has a rank <= 2 survivor gate.
  no rank <= 2 survivor gate => dead_components(row) = 0.
Thus a full two-colour blocker-saturation counterexample cannot hide in
a clean low-rank component.  It must pass through an exact survivor gate
with endpoint labels, branch mask, adjacent cover deltas, and parent even
wall retained.  This is the local object to feed into HYP-3451's
Menger/Green-current/conductance proof route.

